{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55853","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 十 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自小从师学祖宗，闲华犹似缠人蜂。\n僧真不假栖（《景德传灯录》卷二九作「居」）云外，得後无心色亦空（《景德传灯录》作「知无色自空」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}